WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Experience is more than a label. Learn patterns across composition, person, context and time.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Record product composition.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Include person, context and time.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Follow patterns longitudinally.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Separate observation from causation.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Learn without flattening the person.
